	)
	(text "output = low when measured voltage \nis 57.6V (as TVL1702 is open-drain), as the 1/20 scaled voltage \nis compared to the 12V output from \nthe eval board.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 297.434 159.258 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "2ac79ae8-d1f8-443b-b184-8dc382f3c62d")
	)
	(text "High Voltage Indicator Light"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 41.402 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
		)
		(uuid "3dffa2e6-cfe8-432e-a84a-a80258c3705a")
	)
	(text "V is scaled by 1/20 as the TV comparator \nhas a maximum voltage rating of 36V, so \nusing this divider the max input (450V detected) \nwill be ~22.5V, and at 60V measured voltage the \noutput will be 3V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.212 273.304 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "4a4e5e85-ce1d-448a-a4c6-e2f60717be87")
	)
	(text "(soon to be high voltage indicator LCD screen)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 41.148 20.574 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5abd4b57-1ee9-480e-87cc-50ab4f3e1223")
	)
	(text "~450V max\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 70.612 61.214 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "5cd27913-163f-4884-9ba9-1ce84b523a74")
	)
	(text "Demonstration circuit 2781A is a nonisolated buck converter \nfeaturing the LT8316. The demo board outputs 12V and maintains \ntight regulation with a load current from 10mA to 0.2A. It is \noptimized to operate over a wide 19V to 600V DC input voltage \nrange. Output voltage accuracy stays within ±1% over the entire \ninput voltage and load range."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 276.352 51.308 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "8586ab8a-55df-4f73-9c60-0a1c76e43dbd")
	)
	(text "A 2.88V reference voltage is used to \ncompensate for the fact that the DC2718 \ncan output 11.6-12.4V, so when the DC2718A \noutputs 12V the V threshold for comparator \noutput becomes 57.6V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 122.682 272.034 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "85f319e5-099a-4e41-b716-4f49493f44cb")
	)
	(text "N-channel MOSFET to drive the output voltage HIGH"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 251.968 215.646 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "866ddd9c-c2c9-48e5-ae62-de4feab47eb1")
	)
	(text "2.88V voltage reference from buck converter 12V output\n"
